@startuml
title getStatus — GET /status/{submissionId}

|#LightBlue|Controller|
|#LightGreen|Service|
|#LightYellow|Adapter|

start

|Controller|

:HTTP GET /v1/submissions/status/{submissionId};

|Service|

:SELECT * FROM spark_submissions WHERE id = {submissionId};

if (Record found?) then (yes)

    if (internalStatus IN (QUEUED, CLAIMED, SUBMITTED)?) then (yes)

        note right: Application registered on Master but waiting for resources,\nor scheduler hasn't reached it yet, or is currently processing it.

        |Controller|

        :Return CreateSubmissionResponse(message=WAITING, submissionId={submissionId}, success=true);
        stop

    else (no)

        if (real submissionId IS NULL?) then (yes)

            :ExternalStatus.fromInternal(internalStatus): COMPLETED→FINISHED, FAILED→FAILED;

            |Controller|

            :Return CreateSubmissionResponse(message=EXTERNAL_STATUS, submissionId={submissionId}, success=true);
            stop

        else (no)

            |Adapter|

            :adapter.getSubmissionStatus(realSubmissionId);

            note right
              Local: process.isAlive→RUNNING, exit 0→FINISHED, exit!=0→FAILED
              Standalone: REST /v1/submissions/status/{id}, fromStandaloneState
              K8s: fromK8sPhase (Pending→WAITING, Running→RUNNING, Succeeded→FINISHED, Failed→FAILED)
              YARN: REST /ws/v1/cluster/apps/{id}, fromYarnState
            end note

            |Controller|

            :Return CreateSubmissionResponse(message=EXTERNAL_STATUS, submissionId={submissionId});
            stop

        endif

    endif

else (no)

    |Controller|

    :Return CreateSubmissionResponse(message=NOT_FOUND, submissionId={submissionId}, success=false);
    stop

endif

@enduml
